  "abstract": "Implements a hybrid of oscillatory SSM factors (specialist for high\u2011freq) and an explicit low\u2011freq trend head (level+slope) mixed per factor via input\u2011adaptive gate m[b,k]. LayerNorm after gating, residual copy head, curvature regularization, and V-orthogonality.",
